---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import SiteHeader from "../components/SiteHeader.astro";
import SiteFooter from "../components/SiteFooter.astro";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Affiliate Disclosure | Re-Matter India"
  description="Learn how affiliate links may support Re-Matter India."
>
  <SiteHeader />
  <main class="container legal-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">TRANSPARENCY</p>
    <h1>Affiliate disclosure</h1>
    <p>Some links on this website may be affiliate links. If you click a link and make a qualifying purchase, we may earn a commission at no additional cost to you.</p>
    <p>Affiliate relationships do not guarantee that a product is the best choice for you. Please compare products and review the retailer's terms, shipping charges, return policy, and final checkout price before purchasing.</p>
    <p>Prices, stock, promotions and eligibility can change. Unless expressly stated and verified, offers on this site should not be treated as real-time or guaranteed.</p>
    <p>Before launch, update this page to name the affiliate programmes you actually participate in and ensure the wording complies with their terms and applicable Indian advertising and consumer-protection requirements.</p>
    <a class="back-link" href="/">← Back to deals</a>
  </main>
  <SiteFooter />
</BaseLayout>
<style>
  :global(body) { margin: 0; color: #102a43; font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif; }
  :global(.container) { width: min(800px, calc(100% - 40px)); margin-inline: auto; }
  :global(.site-header), :global(.site-footer) { padding: 22px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #e3eaf1; }
  :global(.header-inner), :global(.footer-inner) { width: min(1120px, calc(100% - 40px)); margin: auto; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; }
  :global(.brand) { font-weight: 800; text-decoration: none; } :global(nav) { display: flex; gap: 16px; } :global(nav a) { color: #486581; text-decoration: none; font-size: .9rem; }
  .legal-page { padding-block: 65px 90px; min-height: 65vh; }
  .eyebrow { color: #bf7d00; font-size: .75rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .14em; }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(2.3rem, 6vw, 3.7rem); letter-spacing: -.05em; }
  p { color: #486581; font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8; }
  .back-link { display: inline-block; margin-top: 20px; color: #102a43; font-weight: 700; }
  :global(.footer-inner) { color: #829ab1; font-size: .8rem; }
</style>
